hewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-05T14:40:05-08:00","id":1278864,"title":"","content":"So I did a thing... The thing is to be sang to the tune below. If the rhythm doesn't match, sing to something else:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b3uIKzgcDxo\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a><br /> <br /> Invasion of the sea cucumbers!<br /> Invasion of the sea cucumbers!<br /> They're sticky, icky, slimy, squicky<br /> Spill their guts at thee<br /> And flaunt their vile forms for all good folk to see!<br /> They occupy the streets<br /> Hide with your luncheon meats<br /> They'll slime you, squick you<br /> With your outrage stick you to the floor<br /> Resist! What are you waiting for?<br /> <br /> My marriage is full of strife<br /> Since one scandalized my wife<br /> She turned around and she did see<br /> A sin against all decency<br /> Now she sleeps separately!<br /> <br /> We must find a way to resist<br /> To make them cease, make them desist<br /> They must be also communist<br /> Secure your bed and make a list<br /> It's time to pop them like a cyst!<br /> <br /> I fear for my own progeny<br /> Harassed by alien phylogeny<br /> The teachers have all thrown their hands<br /> Role models ran from seashore sands<br /> Cucumbers have take